WEBVTT

00:00:12.860 --> 00:00:14.870
<i>S-She doesn't stand a chance!</i>

00:00:14.860 --> 00:00:15.480
<b>Aoi</b>

00:00:14.860 --> 00:00:15.480
<b>Amawashi</b>

00:00:14.860 --> 00:00:15.480
<b>Hitomi</b>

00:00:14.860 --> 00:00:15.480
<b>Sato</b>

00:00:17.250 --> 00:00:20.940
<i>Sato was the 2nd place winner 
at last year's Kanto tournament!</i>

00:00:21.230 --> 00:00:25.360
<i>So this is the golf world's 
new star, Aoi Amawashi,</i>

00:00:25.360 --> 00:00:29.480
<i>the daughter of Seira Amawashi 
and Kazuhiko Hodaka...</i>

00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:34.010
A gentle breeze from the front left.

00:00:34.010 --> 00:00:36.180
It won't have much effect.

00:00:36.670 --> 00:00:41.680
With this pin position, you should aim right 
of the fairway, at a distance of 220 yards.

00:00:42.530 --> 00:00:44.670
Amane, let me try this.

00:00:45.150 --> 00:00:47.280
The 48-inch?

00:00:47.280 --> 00:00:48.570
No, Aoi!

00:00:48.570 --> 00:00:50.600
You're still growing.

00:00:50.600 --> 00:00:54.990
You should wait for your body 
to finish growing to use it!

00:00:54.990 --> 00:00:56.680
I want to use it anyway!

00:00:56.680 --> 00:01:01.200
Don't forget that the goal of this practice match 
is to get you ready for the tournament.

00:01:01.720 --> 00:01:04.610
When I get back to school, 
my match with Eve awaits.

00:01:04.610 --> 00:01:06.510
I'm going to need this club then.

00:01:06.510 --> 00:01:11.210
Which is more important, your match 
with that girl or the tournament?

00:01:11.520 --> 00:01:13.390
Both are important, of course.

00:01:13.620 --> 00:01:16.930
You really don't listen...

00:01:17.270 --> 00:01:19.390
Mom used to tell me...

00:01:19.390 --> 00:01:24.350
That selfish golfers are stronger.

00:01:25.310 --> 00:01:27.010
<i>Let's go, Pakkun.</i>

00:01:27.010 --> 00:01:28.650
<i>When we get back,</i>

00:01:31.320 --> 00:01:32.920
<i>we can play golf with Eve!</i>

00:01:33.660 --> 00:01:34.760
<i>With Eve...</i>

00:01:39.210 --> 00:01:41.470
Nice shot, Aoi.

00:01:42.500 --> 00:01:43.960
Grandfather!

00:03:18.360 --> 00:03:21.970
You finished with a total of -12 under, huh?

00:03:22.400 --> 00:03:25.340
That birdie at the end was well-done.

00:03:25.340 --> 00:03:27.800
The way you continue to strive 
to improve yourself...

00:03:28.160 --> 00:03:31.970
Your play-style is just like your mother's.

00:03:34.690 --> 00:03:37.910
So, what are you so mad about?

00:03:37.910 --> 00:03:39.520
I'm not mad.

00:03:41.280 --> 00:03:42.790
She's mad, right?

00:03:44.720 --> 00:03:47.350
You can always play a match with her!

00:03:47.350 --> 00:03:48.780
No pouting!

00:03:50.680 --> 00:03:51.860
Excuse me.

00:03:54.160 --> 00:03:55.020
Here you are.

00:03:59.640 --> 00:04:02.320
Grandfather, this cake...

00:04:02.320 --> 00:04:04.510
It's from that place I love in Hokkaido!

00:04:06.120 --> 00:04:08.560
I had it brought specially for you.

00:04:08.560 --> 00:04:10.730
Eat up.

00:04:11.070 --> 00:04:13.040
Thank you so much!

00:04:20.830 --> 00:04:22.470
It's so good!

00:04:22.470 --> 00:04:25.760
Is it? Go on! Eat up!

00:04:25.760 --> 00:04:26.700
Okay!

00:04:28.960 --> 00:04:30.590
<i>She's a child...</i>

00:04:30.590 --> 00:04:32.520
<i></i>Just<i> a child...</i>

00:04:38.330 --> 00:04:40.680
Good boy!

00:04:39.470 --> 00:04:46.640
I heard a rumor that the club president, 
Kinue Jinguuji, was injured.

00:04:46.170 --> 00:04:47.060
Go!

00:04:46.640 --> 00:04:51.070
The epicondylitis in her left 
arm took a turn for the worse.

00:04:51.660 --> 00:04:53.100
Golfer's elbow, huh?

00:04:53.100 --> 00:04:53.770
Come on!

00:04:53.770 --> 00:04:57.140
So she won't be appearing 
in the doubles, then?

00:04:57.630 --> 00:04:58.840
Most likely.

00:04:59.400 --> 00:05:06.160
Seira created that tournament 
just to make Aoi famous.

00:05:06.820 --> 00:05:10.140
She can't be allowed to lose.

00:05:10.140 --> 00:05:12.410
Yes, I understand.

00:05:12.710 --> 00:05:16.560
Coach Amuro dodges the 
question when I bring it up.

00:05:16.560 --> 00:05:19.550
That's why I brought you here.

00:05:18.370 --> 00:05:21.160
Over here! Come!

00:05:19.550 --> 00:05:21.600
I'll just ask you straight.

00:05:21.600 --> 00:05:25.310
Is anyone in that club good 
enough to play alongside Aoi?

00:05:25.310 --> 00:05:27.620
Someone who's sure to win.

00:05:28.150 --> 00:05:30.680
Just one, in my personal opinion.

00:05:32.250 --> 00:05:36.860
A girl whose golf is sharp, 
like a whetted knife.

00:05:37.200 --> 00:05:38.340
And her name?

00:05:39.030 --> 00:05:40.230
Eve.

00:05:40.890 --> 00:05:42.030
No...

00:05:42.650 --> 00:05:45.530
Evangeline F. Kimishima.

00:05:45.530 --> 00:05:49.530
<i>No Matter How Tall a Weed Grows,</i>

00:05:45.530 --> 00:05:49.530
<i>It Will Never Reach the Sun</i>

00:05:52.110 --> 00:05:55.410
You two don't need to join 
the rest of the girls for practice.

00:05:55.830 --> 00:05:59.300
Eve's past the point where 
she needs tips on technique.

00:05:59.970 --> 00:06:03.020
Instead, I want you to get 
used to a Japanese course.

00:06:03.020 --> 00:06:06.280
Japanese wind. Grass. 
The depth of the rough.

00:06:06.280 --> 00:06:08.260
The state of the green.

00:06:08.260 --> 00:06:10.890
Learn it until it's second nature.

00:06:11.540 --> 00:06:13.360
And here.

00:06:13.360 --> 00:06:16.380
Learn to master these clubs.

00:06:17.350 --> 00:06:21.320
These are Athena's best models!

00:06:21.320 --> 00:06:23.320
Type-E Titanium on the driver face!

00:06:23.320 --> 00:06:25.450
Next-gen "Necklace" carbon on the shaft!

00:06:25.450 --> 00:06:28.450
And the iron's made of hybrid tungsten!

00:06:28.720 --> 00:06:29.780
Is that impressive?

00:06:29.780 --> 00:06:31.740
Impressive, and impressively expensive!

00:06:31.740 --> 00:06:35.390
By the way, Amawashi uses 
a custom model of the same type.

00:06:35.390 --> 00:06:38.330
Like Char's custom model.

00:06:38.780 --> 00:06:40.960
The same as Aoi, huh?

00:06:41.310 --> 00:06:44.610
I've reserved the Athena Golf Course 
for you for three days.

00:06:44.610 --> 00:06:46.460
Play all you like.

00:06:46.460 --> 00:06:48.750
Athena Golf Course?

00:06:48.750 --> 00:06:50.190
Do you mean...

00:06:50.190 --> 00:06:53.200
Saotome, you help Eve.

00:06:53.200 --> 00:06:55.610
O-Okay, got it!

00:06:59.170 --> 00:07:00.770
Come on, let's go.

00:07:00.770 --> 00:07:05.580
Club President Jinguuji! I-Is your arm okay?

00:07:05.580 --> 00:07:07.200
Just get in the car.

00:07:12.080 --> 00:07:13.370
<i>Coach Amuro!</i>

00:07:14.440 --> 00:07:16.790
Let me go, too!

00:07:17.040 --> 00:07:19.280
Planning to bully Eve?

00:07:19.610 --> 00:07:22.190
Her golf is still an unknown to me.

00:07:23.170 --> 00:07:24.420
There are things that even I,

00:07:24.420 --> 00:07:28.530
no, especially I can do.

00:07:30.970 --> 00:07:32.320
Alright.

00:07:32.320 --> 00:07:34.810
She's a diamond in the rough. Go polish her.

00:07:34.810 --> 00:07:36.050
But...

00:07:43.840 --> 00:07:46.360
The real thing is totally different...

00:07:46.360 --> 00:07:48.480
Rub, rub, rub, rub.

00:07:55.200 --> 00:07:57.160
Eve's not here?

00:07:57.530 --> 00:08:01.760
Her teacher said she's been 
given a 3-day excused absence.

00:08:01.760 --> 00:08:03.900
Saotome's with her.

00:08:05.680 --> 00:08:08.040
How long...

00:08:08.040 --> 00:08:11.400
... is this going to keep happening?

00:08:13.260 --> 00:08:17.260
Hole 5 is 175 yards with a Par 3.

00:08:18.600 --> 00:08:22.480
With your strength, a 5 
will be more than good enough.

00:08:22.480 --> 00:08:25.320
Watch out for the bunker 
on the left of the green.

00:08:29.600 --> 00:08:31.900
<i>She's strong enough...</i>

00:08:32.390 --> 00:08:34.910
<i>And has a strong core.</i>

00:08:34.910 --> 00:08:36.990
<i>And then she unleashes...</i>

00:08:39.580 --> 00:08:41.700
<i>that piercing trajectory.</i>

00:08:48.090 --> 00:08:50.350
Nice work, Eve!

00:08:50.350 --> 00:08:52.560
I'm not used to the clubs yet.

00:08:52.850 --> 00:08:55.330
You've gotten 2 birdies in 5 holes.

00:08:55.330 --> 00:08:58.540
Pretty good for your first round.

00:09:01.270 --> 00:09:03.360
P-President?

00:09:08.360 --> 00:09:10.350
What is this? Bullying?

00:09:10.810 --> 00:09:15.000
I heard you met Kaoruko Iijima from Koran.

00:09:15.000 --> 00:09:16.490
And?

00:09:16.490 --> 00:09:18.680
If you want to fight her,

00:09:18.680 --> 00:09:22.110
you'll need to be able to 
overcome a handicap like this.

00:09:22.430 --> 00:09:24.160
You're testing me?

00:09:24.520 --> 00:09:26.420
Interpret it however you want.

00:09:26.860 --> 00:09:28.220
Sand wedge.

00:09:28.220 --> 00:09:30.000
O-Okay!

00:09:30.640 --> 00:09:33.500
I've got a whole rainbow's worth of bullets.

00:09:35.050 --> 00:09:37.090
Show me you're more than just talk.

00:09:44.880 --> 00:09:46.930
Eve, you're too high!

00:09:46.930 --> 00:09:47.320
Aim for the—

00:09:47.320 --> 00:09:49.570
Don't tell me to aim for the right.

00:09:49.820 --> 00:09:51.680
If you want to be my caddy.

00:09:53.450 --> 00:09:55.560
You're going to get hit.

00:09:55.560 --> 00:09:57.560
If you can get it out, that is, right?

00:09:58.810 --> 00:10:01.320
When people want a fight, 
I always give them more...

00:10:01.320 --> 00:10:03.400
...than they bargained for.

00:10:04.310 --> 00:10:06.960
<i>This is my yellow bullet!</i>

00:10:07.640 --> 00:10:09.660
<i>Escaping...</i>

00:10:10.080 --> 00:10:11.920
<i>Yellow Bullet!</i>

00:10:15.920 --> 00:10:17.510
Nice!

00:10:20.190 --> 00:10:21.880
Good work.

00:10:21.880 --> 00:10:25.560
But that angle and speed 
would've taken you off the green.

00:10:28.690 --> 00:10:30.270
Again.

00:10:30.270 --> 00:10:32.180
You little...

00:10:34.890 --> 00:10:36.150
<i>Escaping...</i>

00:10:36.680 --> 00:10:38.160
<i>Yellow Bullet!</i>

00:10:50.720 --> 00:10:52.400
You're getting too tense.

00:10:52.400 --> 00:10:54.130
When did you—

00:10:54.130 --> 00:10:56.130
I didn't even see her move...

00:10:56.830 --> 00:11:00.630
Amawashi could get out of this easily.

00:11:00.960 --> 00:11:02.220
Of course...

00:11:04.030 --> 00:11:05.430
So can I.

00:11:06.200 --> 00:11:08.480
<i>The sand barely moved!</i>

00:11:08.480 --> 00:11:11.220
<i>Her touch is so soft and delicate...</i>

00:11:14.190 --> 00:11:15.800
Right in front of the pin.

00:11:16.710 --> 00:11:20.580
Mizuho Himekawa would've 
gotten it in the hole.

00:11:20.580 --> 00:11:22.580
Who's that?

00:11:23.090 --> 00:11:24.870
Mizuho Himekawa.

00:11:24.870 --> 00:11:28.130
Nagaminami Girls' unbeatable ace.

00:11:28.130 --> 00:11:30.920
The strongest Japanese high school golfer.

00:11:30.920 --> 00:11:33.590
She won the All-Japan 
Women's Amateur last year.

00:11:34.440 --> 00:11:38.120
The wall you're about 
to challenge is very tall.

00:11:38.740 --> 00:11:41.200
Do you think you can jump over it?

00:11:41.840 --> 00:11:43.340
Jump over it?

00:11:43.340 --> 00:11:44.510
Of course not.

00:11:47.400 --> 00:11:48.980
<i>Escaping...</i>

00:11:50.440 --> 00:11:52.480
<i>Yellow Bullet!</i>

00:12:13.480 --> 00:12:14.970
It went in!

00:12:16.320 --> 00:12:18.620
I'll blast right through that wall...

00:12:19.510 --> 00:12:21.600
...with my bullets!

00:14:13.970 --> 00:14:16.080
You're a sadist, you know that?

00:14:16.600 --> 00:14:18.280
I get that a lot.

00:14:18.820 --> 00:14:22.330
Now, finish by playing 
a 1 hole match with me.

00:14:22.330 --> 00:14:24.330
I'll make you wish you'd never said that.

00:14:24.330 --> 00:14:28.800
I return those words to you.

00:14:30.640 --> 00:14:35.790
The most important part of a shot is how you transfer 
your power through the club and into the ball.

00:14:42.440 --> 00:14:44.840
That's past 220!

00:14:44.840 --> 00:14:46.940
With that swing speed...

00:14:49.450 --> 00:14:52.150
Are you just going to swing 
as hard as you can again?

00:14:52.150 --> 00:14:54.050
Yeah, I sure am.

00:14:55.120 --> 00:14:58.170
You need to load the 
bullet with gunpowder...

00:14:58.960 --> 00:15:02.750
Or it won't fly!

00:15:07.810 --> 00:15:10.180
More! More!

00:15:11.820 --> 00:15:14.020
Pass through the wall!

00:15:17.250 --> 00:15:18.280
How about that?

00:15:18.280 --> 00:15:23.010
Do you think a shot like 
that will throw me off my game?

00:15:23.010 --> 00:15:24.200
I see.

00:15:26.570 --> 00:15:29.560
For the second shot,

00:15:29.560 --> 00:15:32.890
there's a hill going right 
diagonally across the green.

00:15:32.890 --> 00:15:37.360
I aim... for the far left of the green!

00:15:45.500 --> 00:15:48.760
Now the chance of a birdie goes way up.

00:15:48.760 --> 00:15:50.910
I don't like playing that way.

00:15:50.910 --> 00:15:56.640
If you ask me, you gave 
up your chance at an eagle.

00:15:59.210 --> 00:16:01.520
<i>Just aim for the cup.</i>

00:16:02.640 --> 00:16:06.140
<i>That's the golf I've always played.</i>

00:16:07.730 --> 00:16:11.560
Eve, aim for the top half of the green.

00:16:11.840 --> 00:16:13.910
Just smash it in.

00:16:14.860 --> 00:16:16.490
Now you're getting it.

00:16:16.490 --> 00:16:18.830
You're easy to understand.

00:16:19.130 --> 00:16:21.830
<i>Yes, that's right.</i>

00:16:22.080 --> 00:16:26.580
<i>I didn't spend the last 
three days teaching you golf.</i>

00:16:27.590 --> 00:16:32.400
<i>I wanted to see your 
resolve... and your light...</i>

00:16:37.900 --> 00:16:39.870
<i>I'm a weed.</i>

00:16:39.870 --> 00:16:42.120
<i>No matter how much effort I put in,</i>

00:16:42.120 --> 00:16:44.320
<i>I'll never be more than "very good."</i>

00:16:45.250 --> 00:16:47.510
<i>I wanted to be the person 
he wanted me to be...</i>

00:16:55.550 --> 00:17:00.120
<i>I overdid it so much, 
I destroyed my left elbow.</i>

00:17:00.640 --> 00:17:04.630
<i>I doused the light I was given.</i>

00:17:09.790 --> 00:17:12.080
<i>So show me...</i>

00:17:12.460 --> 00:17:14.650
<i>That you and Amawashi are different!</i>

00:17:15.450 --> 00:17:19.530
<i>You are the chosen, 
born with a light of your own...</i>

00:17:20.300 --> 00:17:22.610
<i>And a strong will that can never be broken.</i>

00:17:24.430 --> 00:17:27.110
<i>You'll trample on a weed and keep going...</i>

00:17:29.280 --> 00:17:31.290
<i>And I am that weed.</i>

00:17:38.120 --> 00:17:39.480
Alright.

00:17:39.480 --> 00:17:41.750
She's a diamond in the rough. Go polish her.

00:17:42.430 --> 00:17:44.700
But don't go too far.

00:17:44.700 --> 00:17:46.490
No, I will.

00:17:46.750 --> 00:17:50.080
Do you intend to quit golf?

00:17:50.080 --> 00:17:56.510
Coach, thank you for spending so much 
effort on a talentless person like me.

00:17:57.650 --> 00:18:01.590
It's thanks to you that 
I was able to jump this high.

00:18:03.790 --> 00:18:09.370
The doctors told me that even if my 
left elbow gets better, it may come back.

00:18:10.160 --> 00:18:13.440
I can't... jump any higher.

00:18:15.760 --> 00:18:21.380
I'll entrust the dream I can 
never have to Amawashi and Eve!

00:18:24.130 --> 00:18:25.290
Alright.

00:18:26.220 --> 00:18:29.190
But I want you to stay 
on as captain of the golf club.

00:18:29.940 --> 00:18:32.060
I need you here.

00:18:32.960 --> 00:18:36.430
I will... I will!

00:18:40.810 --> 00:18:44.050
Kazuhiko, I'm a monster.

00:18:44.420 --> 00:18:48.880
I forced her to hurt herself, 
to let that girl win.

00:18:50.080 --> 00:18:53.020
But I want that girl to win, 
no matter what...

00:18:53.870 --> 00:18:56.330
For that to happen, I'll...

00:18:57.650 --> 00:18:58.660
I see.

00:18:58.660 --> 00:19:00.570
You've made your choice, then.

00:19:01.070 --> 00:19:04.320
<i>Yes. I'm sorry it took so long.</i>

00:19:04.320 --> 00:19:07.680
Jinguuji was a good golfer, wasn't she?

00:19:08.420 --> 00:19:10.870
<i>It's entirely my fault.</i>

00:19:11.500 --> 00:19:14.320
I'll be expecting a win at the championship.

00:19:14.320 --> 00:19:15.400
<i>Of course.</i>

00:19:20.870 --> 00:19:22.830
Everyone, gather up.

00:19:23.310 --> 00:19:28.120
I'm going to announce our 
players for next month's

00:19:28.120 --> 00:19:30.860
All-Japan Girls High School 
Golf Doubles Championship.

00:19:30.860 --> 00:19:34.780
The first player will be 
Aoi Amawashi from year 1.

00:19:34.780 --> 00:19:35.440
Thank you, sir!

00:19:35.440 --> 00:19:36.600
Coach!

00:19:36.600 --> 00:19:41.860
Just so everyone's clear, 
I chose her for her golfing ability.

00:19:41.860 --> 00:19:44.710
Not who her family is.

00:19:45.360 --> 00:19:46.310
Is there a problem?

00:19:46.310 --> 00:19:48.960
No, nothing.

00:19:48.960 --> 00:19:50.840
The second is...

00:19:51.290 --> 00:19:53.340
I apologize for being late.

00:19:55.250 --> 00:19:58.540
The second player will be 
Evangeline F. Kimishima.

00:20:00.040 --> 00:20:01.000
No way!

00:20:01.000 --> 00:20:02.420
Whoa!

00:20:02.420 --> 00:20:04.290
What?

00:20:04.290 --> 00:20:06.640
You're going to the championship.

00:20:06.640 --> 00:20:09.920
R-Really? Isn't this awesome, Eve?

00:20:09.920 --> 00:20:11.770
Yeah...

00:20:11.770 --> 00:20:13.770
Now you can fight...

00:20:13.770 --> 00:20:18.730
both Kaoruko Iijima from Koran 
and Mizuho Himekawa from Nada.

00:20:19.850 --> 00:20:21.770
That sounds fun.

00:20:21.770 --> 00:20:23.480
Let's do this, Eve.

00:20:23.740 --> 00:20:28.450
Still, I'm sure some of you 
are doubtful that Evangeline,

00:20:28.450 --> 00:20:30.610
who just joined, is the right choice.

00:20:31.080 --> 00:20:32.700
Amawashi, Eve.

00:20:32.700 --> 00:20:35.490
Go to the practice hole 
and play a 1 hole match.

00:20:35.490 --> 00:20:38.030
Play a game that impresses 
the other members.

00:20:38.030 --> 00:20:39.000
Yes, sir.

00:20:39.000 --> 00:20:40.630
Show me your power.

00:20:40.630 --> 00:20:41.590
Sure thing.

00:20:45.210 --> 00:20:47.050
It's been a long time.

00:20:47.050 --> 00:20:48.960
But we can finally play.

00:20:49.280 --> 00:20:51.720
You just disappeared on me!

00:20:51.720 --> 00:20:54.450
So did you!

00:20:59.610 --> 00:21:01.380
Just start.

00:21:02.750 --> 00:21:04.230
Who gets honor?

00:21:04.230 --> 00:21:06.830
Let's both shoot at the same time. 
It can be a driving contest.

00:21:09.640 --> 00:21:12.050
The 48-incher here, huh?

00:21:12.050 --> 00:21:13.290
You're serious, huh?

00:21:13.290 --> 00:21:14.490
So are you.

00:21:17.000 --> 00:21:19.960
<i>Now let's go, Pakkun...</i>

00:21:19.960 --> 00:21:21.600
<i>Direct strike...</i>

00:21:22.500 --> 00:21:26.680
<i>Blue Bullet!</i>

00:23:08.690 --> 00:23:11.010
That sure was a close 
birdie for you, huh, Eve?

00:23:11.010 --> 00:23:12.960
A birdie's a birdie!

00:23:12.960 --> 00:23:16.120
Don't hassle me just 'cause 
you lost the driving contest.

00:23:16.120 --> 00:23:19.920
I-I hadn't warmed up 'cause 
I wasn't expecting a match...

00:23:19.920 --> 00:23:22.880
Your 48-incher's crying.

00:23:24.480 --> 00:23:27.380
I'm better close to the pin.

00:23:27.380 --> 00:23:30.200
Well, that's not what we were doing.

00:23:28.660 --> 00:23:30.200
Will a pair like this...

00:23:30.200 --> 00:23:32.320
Eve, do you not like me?

00:23:30.200 --> 00:23:32.880
...be able to win?

00:23:32.320 --> 00:23:34.080
I don't like you or dislike you.

00:23:34.080 --> 00:23:36.090
What does that mean?

00:23:35.300 --> 00:23:36.640
Right, right.

00:23:36.090 --> 00:23:38.060
Why are you so mean?

00:23:38.120 --> 00:23:39.900
Eve?

00:23:39.890 --> 00:23:49.850
Next Episode

00:23:40.440 --> 00:23:43.240
Saotome, are Aoi and Eve okay together?

00:23:43.240 --> 00:23:45.320
Amawashi is one thing, 
but Eve's aggressive...

00:23:45.320 --> 00:23:47.190
She already picked a fight 
with another school!

00:23:47.190 --> 00:23:48.770
More Birdie Birdie next week!
